 in terms  of graphics because of 10th jen has  louder speakers and you can actually buy  the surface a lower end model that has  128 gigs of SSD for just 999 dollars and  keep in mind for a hundred thirty bucks  you can pop in a 512 gig SSD and that  makes it such a great value at the lower  price points because of the performance  that you're getting  unfortunately screen is reflective but  that's about it now  if you're looking at the higher-end  models then the MacBook Pro starts to  become a better value because for the  price point you're actually it gets cost  you less for the i5 spec without similar  performance and the same size SSD and  you're getting four Thunderbolt three  ports where the surface is just stuck  with one USB type-c port and of course  we do have OS differences with the  MacBook Pro yet Mac OS which a lot of  people like so if you're looking for the  higher-end models  I think the MacBook Pro is definitely a  better buy but for that low end the  surface really packs a really good punch  I'm gonna have links where you can get  the best deals on both of these down in  the video description below  let me know your guys's thoughts in the  comments section and click above to  subscribe if you guys want to see  another great video we have a couple of  right over there there's been max max  tech and I'll see you in the next video  [Music]

